Code adapted from eve

The @open-everywhere/provider-teams package includes source code adapted from
eve 1.0.0-rc.18, which Vercel licenses under the Apache License, Version 2.0
("Copyright 2026 Vercel, Inc. and contributors"). eve 1.0 no longer exports
these Microsoft Teams helpers, so the package carries its own copies. The Open
Everywhere authors changed them: they added types, renamed internals, and moved
them into these files of the package:

  agent/channels/teams-html-markdown.ts
  agent/channels/teams-inbound.ts
  agent/channels/teams-message-text.ts
  agent/channels/teams-connector.ts
  agent/channels/teams-credentials.ts
  agent/channels/teams-verify.ts

Each file names the eve source it adapts. The eve attribution notice above
applies to them.

